--- a/axum/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/axum/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -11,10 +11,14 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
   Use `axum::middleware::from_extractor` instead ([#1077])
 - **breaking:** Allow `Error: Into<Infallible>` for `Route::{layer, route_layer}` ([#924])
 - **breaking:** `MethodRouter` now panics on overlapping routes ([#1102])
+- **breaking:** Trailing slash redirects have been removed. Requests to a path with a missing
+  or extra trailing slash are now sent to the fallback instead of being redirected. If you
+  want both `/foo` and `/foo/` to work, add routes for both paths ([#1119])
 
